    "explication_yww": [
        {
            "_jp": "そもそも必要のない足がムダに 冷えるらしく靴下をはいている。 コイツにとりつかれると 余計な一言ばかり言ってしまい 友達との関係が冷えてしまう。",
            "_en": "I'm wearing socks because my feet don't need them in the first place and they seem to get cold. When I get obsessed with this guy, I end up saying unnecessary things and my relationships with my friends get cold.",
